  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">About our brand and products:</strong><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">We’re an online DIY, home improvement, and garden store for homeowners and makers who like to fix, build, and upgrade things themselves. Our catalog covers everything from hand tools and power tools to hardware, paint accessories, and garden supplies – all with competitive pricing and fast delivery so projects don’t have to wait.</p><p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">What makes us different:</strong></p><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Carefully selected tools and materials that are actually useful for real‑life DIY projects (not just “gadget” products)</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">A clear focus on home, garden, and workshop needs – so your audience finds everything for their next project in one place</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Fair prices in EUR and quick shipping, ideal for EU‑based DIYers and homeowners</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Friendly support to help customers choose the right tool or solution for their job</li></ul><p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Earn a commission on every qualifying order placed through your unique affiliate link or coupon code (tracked automatically via UpPromote) </li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Ongoing commissions as long as your audience keeps shopping with us, based on our program rules and cookie duration</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Extra earning potential during promos, seasonal campaigns, and special product pushes when we offer higher commissions or bonuses </li></ul><p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">How to promote us:</strong></p><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Create how‑to content: tutorials, before/after projects, and tool reviews featuring our products, then add your affiliate links</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Share quick tips and project ideas on social media (Reels, TikToks, Stories, Pinterest) with your link or coupon in bio/captions</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Write blog posts or newsletters about DIY projects, home upgrades, or garden makeovers and link directly to the products you use (deep links) </li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Run seasonal content around spring gardening, summer outdoor projects, or winter home maintenance and highlight our best‑selling items</li></ul><p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Other information:</strong></p><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:0px 0px 1em;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">We provide affiliates with ready‑to‑use assets like product images, banners, and branded visuals to make promotion easier </li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">You’ll get access to an affiliate dashboard (via UpPromote) where you can:<ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\"><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Track clicks, orders, sales, and commissions in real time</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Grab your links and coupons</li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">Download media and program guidelines </li></ul></li><li style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(9,44,76);\">We welcome creators of all sizes – from DIY bloggers and YouTubers to Instagram/TikTok creators and home‑improvement enthusiasts.</li></ul></div></div>",
